Mirror's Edge
  Faith's body, animations, textures and sounds come from the player's own Mirror's Edge install:
  the launcher copies the 16 package files they're in from it into the player's own GTA V folder,
  on the player's PC. None of it is in this repository or its releases.

Rust crates
  Faith Runner V: glam, windows (Microsoft), rodio, lewton. The launcher: tao and wry (Tauri
  Programme), ureq, zip, rfd, winreg, sha2, trash, serde and windows-sys. Each keeps its own MIT
  and/or Apache-2.0 licence.
